    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1615">

                <pb facs="1276" n="1266" xml:id="pg1266"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 McConaughy, Walter P.: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >McConaughy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-04">August 4, 1949.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 4—5:53 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3023. I assumed charge of this Consulate General at COB<anchor n="43"
                        xml:id="d1615-f1"/> July 15 when Cabot left for Nanking. Official
                    announcement withheld until Cabot’s departure from China.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 3023; repeated Nanking 1684, OffEmb Canton 941.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
